        <font color="midnightblue" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica" size="2"> Wow.</P><P>I'd always thought EQ would be like UO and be around forever.  It's really starting to not look that way.  Even the diehard players with the "I've got so much invested" are leaving finally.</P><P>It's funny, I logged on my free AO account (a game I REALLY expected to be gone by now) and it's still alive and kicking well.  Quite a few newbies in the newbie zone (Kaashar's guage of how well a MMOG's doing; check the newbie zones.  If you start seeing them empty the game is on it's way out).</P><P>Farewell E'CI.  Moving my beloved Tier'Dal family to Tunare wouln't have been my first choice of places, but I haven't played in ages.</P><P></P><P><font size=1><font color=red>(Retired)EverQuest:</font id=red> <b>Kaashar Do'Van</b> 65 Necromancer<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Kanr Do'Van</b> 65 Cleric<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Kamaria</b> 65 Druid<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Kilnoar Do'Van</b> 56 Shadow Knight<BR><font color=red>(RIP E&B)Earth and Beyond:</font id=red><b>Kaashar</b> 150 Terran Trader<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Kilnoar </b>150 Jenquai Explorer<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Doshan </b>150 Jenquai Warrior<BR>(Retired)<BR><font color=red>Shadowbane:</font id=red> <b>Kaashar Do'Van</b> 52 Druid<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>-Shaft-</b> 53 Confessor<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Vaashar</b> 32 Druid<BR><font color=red>(Retired)DAOC:</font id=red><b>Kaashar Do'Van</b> 50 Necromancer<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Kamaria</b> 48 Druid<BR><font color=red>(Retired)Priston Tale:</font id=red><b>Doshan</b> 40 Wizard<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>PoleCat</b> 35 Pikeman<BR><font color=red>(Retired)Star Wars Galaxies:</font id=red><b>Kaashar  Do'Van</b> Master Creature Handler,Pistoleer,Rifleman,Combat Medic<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Kilnoar</b> Master Pistoleer,Doctor and Musician<BR><font color=red>(Retired)Anarchy Online:</font id=red><b>Kaashar</b> 191 Nanomage Meta Physicist<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Flnx</b> 165 Atrox Enforcer<BR><font color=red>World of Warcraft:</font id=red><b>Kanr</b> 60 Druid<font color=red>/</font id=red><b>Lomandar</b> 60 Hunter</font id=size1><a href="#top"><img src="icon_go_up.gif" height=15 width=15 border="0" align="right" alt="Go to Top of Page"></a></font></td>
